12. On the other hand, the learned counsel for the respondent no.3, placing reliance on the following judgments, submits that such a claim has rightly been rejected by the learned Tribunal:
i) National Insurance Co.Ltd. v. Rajesh Kumar & Anr., 2011 SCC OnLine Del 2844;
ii) New India Assurance Co. Ltd. v. Andhra Pradesh State Road Transport Corpn.,
Musheerabad & Anr., 2008 SCC OnLine AP 275;
iii) Amar Singh v. Ranbir Singh &Ors., 2011 SCC P&H 1261;
and,
iv) National Insurance Co. Ltd. v. Himachal Road Transport Corporation & Ors.,
2009 SCC OnLine HP 2854.
